    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The King’s Victory"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director. A psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, the king finds joy in your strength.",
          "How greatly he rejoices in your victory!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You have given him his heart’s desire",
          "and have not denied the request of his lips."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For you meet him with rich blessings;",
          "you place a crown of pure gold on his head."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He asked you for life, and you gave it to him —",
          "length of days forever and ever."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His glory is great through your victory;",
          "you confer majesty and splendor on him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You give him blessings forever;",
          "you cheer him with joy in your presence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the king relies on the Lord;",
          "through the faithful love of the Most High",
          "he is not shaken."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Your hand will capture all your enemies;",
          "your right hand will seize those who hate you."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You will make them burn",
          "like a fiery furnace when you appear;",
          "the Lord will engulf them in his wrath,",
          "and fire will devour them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You will wipe their progeny from the earth",
          "and their offspring from the human race. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Though they intend to harm you",
          "and devise a wicked plan, they will not prevail."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Instead, you will put them to flight",
          "when you ready your bowstrings to shoot at them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Be exalted, Lord, in your strength;",
          "we will sing and praise your might."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
